The Technical Account Manager provides the customer’s business with proactive support and management during Veeam implementations and beyond. The TAM’s mission is to help the customers unlock the full value of Veeam’s products and services and serve as your trusted advisor.

The &nbsp;Technical Account Manager &nbsp;is a technical team member responsible for all aspects of the planning, architecture, coordination, and management of post-sales technical engagements.&nbsp;&nbsp;

The focus is on architecting and project management of availability solutions, including data protection and monitoring. The Technical Account manager is an expert in the areas of Data Management, Data Analytics, Business Continuity, Data Center, Cloud, Operating Systems, Networking, Storage, and Virtualization. &nbsp;

